---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Data Converter terms and conditions — free to use, no warranty, your responsibility." keywords="terms and conditions, terms of service, data converter" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',url:'/'},{name:'Terms',url:'/terms'}]} schema={{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'Terms & Conditions',
  description: 'Data Converter terms and conditions — free to use, no warranty, your responsibility.',
  about: { '@type': 'Thing', name: 'Terms of Service' },
}}>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: July 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
    <p>Data Converter is provided free of charge, as-is, without any warranty. I work hard to make sure conversions are accurate, but I can't guarantee they'll be perfect for every edge case. You're responsible for verifying your converted data before using it in production or any important context.</p>

    <h2>What You Can Do</h2>
    <p>You're free to use this tool for personal, commercial, or educational purposes. No attribution required.</p>

    <h2>What You Can't Do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Scrape, crawl, or systematically download content from this site.</li>
      <li>Use the tool to process illegal content or data you don't have rights to.</li>
      <li>Attempt to break, overload, or exploit the site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No Liability</h2>
    <p>I'm not liable for any damages or data loss resulting from your use of this tool. Since all processing happens locally in your browser, I don't have access to your data and can't be responsible for what happens to it.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>I may update these terms. Continued use after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about these terms, <a href="/contact">reach out</a>.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .legal em {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 550;
    margin: 28px 0 10px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .legal p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal li {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .legal a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal { margin: 24px auto; }
    .legal h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
